1
00:00:06,132 --> 00:00:07,925
<i>Elizabeth Valdez.</i>

2
00:00:08,008 --> 00:00:10,010
<i>She's a loyalty tester.</i>

3
00:00:10,094 --> 00:00:12,179
<i>Ana put me on a loyalty test.</i>

4
00:00:12,263 --> 00:00:13,889
<i>Right now,</i>
<i>she thinks there's a woman involved.</i>

5
00:00:13,973 --> 00:00:16,308
But once she realizes that's not the case,

6
00:00:16,892 --> 00:00:18,936
<i>she'll become suspicious of other things.</i>

7
00:00:19,019 --> 00:00:21,814
<i>Her coming here means</i>
<i>she knows something.</i>

8
00:00:21,897 --> 00:00:23,482
I can be surprising too.

9
00:00:23,566 --> 00:00:26,068
<i>I'll find a way to throw her off.</i>

10
00:00:27,236 --> 00:00:28,988
I need to catch them in the act

11
00:00:29,071 --> 00:00:31,407
because that will be my proof
that he's cheating on me!

12
00:00:31,991 --> 00:00:34,744
<i>No! No! No! Liar!</i>

13
00:00:34,827 --> 00:00:38,330
<i>Liar! Liar!</i>

14
00:00:38,748 --> 00:00:40,082
Go on. Do it.

15
00:00:40,166 --> 00:00:42,752
And I'll tell Ben everything you did.

16
00:00:42,835 --> 00:00:44,545
<i> Problem solved. It's over.</i>

17
00:00:44,628 --> 00:00:47,715
<i>I hope that's enough to get Ana to stop.</i>

18
00:00:50,593 --> 00:00:52,303
- Ana?
- Hmm?

19
00:00:53,387 --> 00:00:55,431
Everyone knows and sees

20
00:00:55,514 --> 00:00:57,141
how beautiful and talented you are.

21
00:00:59,351 --> 00:01:01,604
But no one really knows
what you are to me.

22
00:01:03,689 --> 00:01:06,942
You... are that ray of sunshine...

23
00:01:10,446 --> 00:01:12,615
that led me out of my...

24
00:01:12,698 --> 00:01:14,325
dead-end maze of a life.

25
00:01:16,285 --> 00:01:17,411
You are proof...

26
00:01:19,246 --> 00:01:20,706
that I deserve...

27
00:01:22,541 --> 00:01:23,876
a good life.

28
00:01:25,961 --> 00:01:28,380
And this is the beginning of my new life.

29
00:01:30,299 --> 00:01:31,842
I found the love...

30
00:01:33,511 --> 00:01:34,762
to live...

31
00:01:35,888 --> 00:01:38,057
and kill for.

32
00:01:40,768 --> 00:01:42,770
Because no one knows
what it really feels like

33
00:01:42,853 --> 00:01:44,396
to be loved by you.

34
00:01:46,065 --> 00:01:47,900
So, on this very lovely day...

35
00:01:50,986 --> 00:01:53,239
...I give you my love eternal,

36
00:01:54,907 --> 00:01:56,325
my loyalty,

37
00:01:58,202 --> 00:01:59,495
and my life.

38
00:02:04,208 --> 00:02:06,210
I love you more than my life, Ana.

39
00:02:07,086 --> 00:02:08,587
I love you more than my life.

40
00:02:12,258 --> 00:02:13,300
Ben,

41
00:02:14,593 --> 00:02:18,889
I promise to be your safe space
when the world feels heavy.

42
00:02:20,891 --> 00:02:22,351
To be your home

43
00:02:23,102 --> 00:02:25,271
when things are uncertain.

44
00:02:26,897 --> 00:02:29,483
To keep choosing you...

45
00:02:29,567 --> 00:02:31,443
again and again

46
00:02:31,861 --> 00:02:34,530
in every version of tomorrow.

47
00:02:35,906 --> 00:02:37,449
I love you.

48
00:02:42,580 --> 00:02:45,749
I now pronounce you man and wife.

49
00:02:45,833 --> 00:02:47,626
You may kiss the bride.

50
00:03:00,264 --> 00:03:02,433
Take two, please.
My husband's in tears.

51
00:03:04,184 --> 00:03:05,144
One more time.

52
00:03:12,568 --> 00:03:13,444
Beautiful.

53
00:03:13,527 --> 00:03:14,820
Let me take that,
Nanny Cedes.

54
00:03:14,904 --> 00:03:16,447
- Thank you very much.
- Okay, sir.

55
00:03:16,530 --> 00:03:19,033
I got this.
I just want this to be perfect.

56
00:03:20,159 --> 00:03:22,244
You're very sweet, sir.

57
00:03:36,175 --> 00:03:38,594
Love?

58
00:03:38,677 --> 00:03:39,595
Ana?

59
00:03:39,678 --> 00:03:41,847
Ah, perfect! Just in time! I...

60
00:03:41,931 --> 00:03:44,391
Ana, what's wrong?

61
00:03:47,436 --> 00:03:48,520
Ana!

62
00:03:50,272 --> 00:03:51,774
Ana, what's wrong?

63
00:04:00,866 --> 00:04:02,034
Ana?

64
00:04:04,036 --> 00:04:05,454
That stupid woman!

65
00:04:05,537 --> 00:04:09,583
She had the nerve to come here,
only to back down in the end!

66
00:04:09,667 --> 00:04:11,001
My goodness.

67
00:04:11,085 --> 00:04:13,462
The way she spoke to me, Diane!

68
00:04:13,545 --> 00:04:17,424
You'd think I was the worst person alive!

69
00:04:17,508 --> 00:04:19,426
Yet she's the one
who doesn't trust her husband,

70
00:04:19,510 --> 00:04:21,470
to the point of putting him
on a loyalty test!

71
00:04:24,932 --> 00:04:27,559
She did this to herself.

72
00:04:27,643 --> 00:04:31,271
