if we should continue this.

73
00:04:31,355 --> 00:04:33,816
She kept saying yes, again and again!

74
00:04:33,899 --> 00:04:35,442
And now it's my fault?

75
00:04:35,526 --> 00:04:37,695
That after being a loyalty tester
for so long,

76
00:04:37,778 --> 00:04:39,029
I've fallen for Ben?

77
00:04:39,113 --> 00:04:40,698
Yes, it's your fault. You fool!

78
00:04:41,490 --> 00:04:42,533
What did you say?

79
00:04:43,200 --> 00:04:45,369
Do you even hear yourself?

80
00:04:45,452 --> 00:04:46,829
Are you seriously blaming Ana
for getting upset

81
00:04:46,912 --> 00:04:48,539
when you flirted with her husband?

82
00:04:48,622 --> 00:04:51,667
Tch. That's how it begins!

83
00:04:51,750 --> 00:04:53,210
Flirting!

84
00:04:55,087 --> 00:04:56,380
I don't care!

85
00:04:57,089 --> 00:04:58,590
I love Ben.

86
00:04:58,674 --> 00:05:00,009
So you really are crazy.

87
00:05:01,093 --> 00:05:02,886
Didn't you say it was nothing?

88
00:05:02,970 --> 00:05:04,138
You lied.

89
00:05:05,055 --> 00:05:07,224
Then fine, call me a liar if you want!

90
00:05:07,933 --> 00:05:09,393
This is how I feel!

91
00:05:09,476 --> 00:05:11,645
Sure, you have feelings.

92
00:05:11,729 --> 00:05:13,480
But for heaven's sake, stop it!

93
00:05:13,564 --> 00:05:16,525
No matter how you look at it,
that fantasy of yours is going nowhere!

94
00:05:57,983 --> 00:05:59,068
Ana.

95
00:06:01,361 --> 00:06:02,780
Are you okay?

96
00:06:04,615 --> 00:06:06,033
Ana, what's wrong?

97
00:06:08,327 --> 00:06:09,912
Hey.

98
00:06:11,080 --> 00:06:12,414
What's wrong?

99
00:06:12,956 --> 00:06:14,792
Stop! Stop! Stop.

100
00:06:15,417 --> 00:06:16,752
Ana, why?

101
00:06:17,795 --> 00:06:19,379
Talk to me.

102
00:06:19,463 --> 00:06:20,464
Ana, please talk to m--

103
00:06:20,547 --> 00:06:22,132
Stop! I said stop!

104
00:06:25,969 --> 00:06:28,847
Okay... please. Please... Ana.

105
00:06:30,182 --> 00:06:31,058
Ana.

106
00:06:33,060 --> 00:06:34,228
Ana, calm down.

107
00:06:36,605 --> 00:06:38,065
You can talk to me. You can talk to me.

108
00:06:38,524 --> 00:06:40,526
We can talk. We can talk, Ana.

109
00:06:40,609 --> 00:06:42,277
Come on, talk to me.

110
00:06:42,361 --> 00:06:44,446
Do you still love me?

111
00:06:44,530 --> 00:06:46,323
Ana, I love you very much.

112
00:06:46,406 --> 00:06:49,409
I love you. I love you so much.

113
00:06:49,493 --> 00:06:52,162
- What's wrong?
- I saw you and Beth.

114
00:06:53,622 --> 00:06:54,873
Where?

115
00:06:56,667 --> 00:06:58,669
At the wharf.

116
00:07:00,170 --> 00:07:02,589
I saw you!

117
00:07:02,673 --> 00:07:04,883
I saw you with her!

118
00:07:04,967 --> 00:07:07,636
- Ana! Ana! Calm down!
- I saw you with her!

119
00:07:07,970 --> 00:07:09,847
I can explain this! I can explain this!

120
00:07:09,930 --> 00:07:11,515
- I can explain this!
- Stop!

121
00:07:11,598 --> 00:07:13,725
You just have to listen to me.
I can explain this.

122
00:07:13,809 --> 00:07:16,436
Yes, I was at the wharf.
She was there too.

123
00:07:16,520 --> 00:07:17,771
It's not what it seems.

124
00:07:17,855 --> 00:07:18,981
I can explain this. Yes, I was--

125
00:07:19,064 --> 00:07:20,774
- You were kissing! You were kissing!
- No, we--

126
00:07:20,858 --> 00:07:22,025
What do you expect me to think?

127
00:07:22,109 --> 00:07:24,111
- She kissed me!
- It's the same thing!

128
00:07:24,194 --> 00:07:25,988
- No! I didn't kiss back!
- That's the same thing!

129
00:07:26,071 --> 00:07:27,489
Please...
just listen to me, please.

130
00:07:27,573 --> 00:07:28,907
- Just please.
- Just stop it.

131
00:07:29,449 --> 00:07:31,535
Are you in a relationship with her?

132
00:07:31,618 --> 00:07:32,953
No!

133
00:07:33,036 --> 00:07:36,081
I am not in a relationship
with anyone else but you.

134
00:07:36,707 --> 00:07:39,376
Ana, please just listen to me.
She's nothing to me, okay?

135
00:07:39,459 --> 00:07:42,546
- She's nothing to me.
- No! You expect me...

136
00:07:42,629 --> 00:07:45,340
to believe that? Huh?

137
00:07:45,424 --> 00:07:49,344
It was just the two of you there!

138
00:07:49,428 --> 00:07:51,180
Ana, I understand you.

139
00:07:51,263 --> 00:07:53,140
But when I arrived,
she was already there.

140
00:07:53,223 --> 00:07:54,433
- I swear--
- And the kiss?

141
00:07:54,516 --> 00:07:56,643
- She kissed me all of a sudden!
- No, no, no!

142
00:07:56,727 --> 00:07:59,188
Ana, she kissed me.
I don't know what she was thinking!

143
00:07:59,730 --> 00:08:00,564
I was surprised!

144
00:08:00,647 --> 00:08:03,442
Ana, I told her,
"What are you doing?"

145
00:08:03,525 --> 00:08:05,360
I saw you!

146
00:08:05,444 --> 00:08:07,154
I was there! I saw it!

147
00:08:07,237 --> 00:08:10,949
Don't lie to me!
I know what I saw!

148
00:08:11,700 --> 00:08:14,578
I love you so much.
I love you so much.

149
00:08:14,661 --> 00:08:16,163
I don't have any other relationships.

150
00:08:16,246 --> 00:08:18,540
I even told her
that I was a married man!

151
00:08:18,624 --> 00:08:20,209
- "What are you doing?"
- No, no!

152
00:08:20,292 --> 00:08:22,211
I'm not stupid!

153
00:08:25,839 --> 00:08:28,342
How could you do that to me?

154
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:32,721
How...

155
00:08:32,804 --> 00:08:35,057
how could you do that to me?

156
00:08:37,517 --> 00:08:39,269
Am I not enough?

157
00:08:39,353 --> 00:08:40,604
You are.

158
00:08:41,396 --> 00:08:42,481
You are enough.

159
00:08:42,564 --> 00:08:44,566
What am I lacking?

160
00:08:44,650 --> 00:08:46,443
Why did you do that to me?

161
00:08:46,526 --> 00:08:47,778
Ana, nothing.

162
00:08:47,861 --> 00:08:51,073
You made me look so stupid!

163
00:08:51,156 --> 00:08:52,491
Don't touch me!

164
00:08:52,574 --> 00:08:54,660
What is it that I'm lacking?

165
00:08:54,743 --> 00:08:55,953
Nothing.
You're more than enough.

166
00:08:56,036 --> 00:08:57,079
How could you do that to me?

167
00:08:57,162 --> 00:08:59,289
Ana, you are perfect to me.

168
00:08:59,373 --> 00:09:00,832
You're perfect, okay?

169
00:09:00,916 --> 00:09:03,585
You are enough. You are more than enough.

170
00:09:03,669 --> 00:09:05,754
You are more
than what I asked and wished for.

171
00:09:05,837 --> 00:09:07,506
Ana, you're the love of my life.

172
00:09:07,881 --> 00:09:09,383
I love you so much.

173
00:09:09,466 --> 00:09:11,510
Only you.
There's no one else.

174
00:09:11,593 --> 00:09:12,719
No...

175
00:09:12,803 --> 00:09:14,721
- Ana, believe me.
- No!

176
00:09:14,805 --> 00:09:16,598
- No...
- Ana, please.

177
00:09:16,682 --> 00:09:18,183
- Stop! You're lying!
- There's no other woman!

178
00:09:18,267 --> 00:09:20,394
- You're only good at lying!
- I'm not! No, I'm--

179
00:09:20,477 --> 00:09:21,353
Ana, I'm not!

180
00:09:21,436 --> 00:09:23,355
Ana.

181
00:09:25,524 --> 00:09:26,608
Ana.

182
00:09:27,567 --> 00:09:28,610
Fuck!

183
00:09:33,115 --> 00:09:35,575
You said you loved me.

184
00:09:35,659 --> 00:09:36,660
Yes.

185
00:09:36,743 --> 00:09:39,496
You said you love me more than your life.

186
00:09:39,579 --> 00:09:41,873
I love you more than my life, Ana.

187
00:09:41,957 --> 00:09:44,209
I love you for as long as I live.

188
00:09:44,835 --> 00:09:48,130
Nothing has changed, Ana.
It's still the same.

189
00:09:48,213 --> 00:09:49,756
Even more, Ana.

190
00:09:50,674 --> 00:09:52,384
Ana, please let me explain.

191
00:09:52,467 --> 00:09:54,136
I have nothing to do with this woman.

192
00:09:54,219 --> 00:09:55,637
I don't know what she did.
She's crazy.

193
00:09:55,721 --> 00:09:56,805
Then why...

194
00:09:56,888 --> 00:10:00,225
why does it hurt like this?

195
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:02,394
Ana, please...

196
00:10:02,477 --> 00:10:04,104
Ana, please talk to me. Come on.

197
00:10:04,187 --> 00:10:05,731
Please open the door.
Let's talk about this.

198
00:10:05,814 --> 00:10:07,316
I love you, Ana. You know that.

199
00:10:08,150 --> 00:10:10,736
You know me better than this, Ana.
I will never lie to you.

200
00:10:10,819 --> 00:10:12,404
I was gonna talk to you about it.

201
00:10:13,071 --> 00:10:14,197
Ana.

202
00:10:18,994 --> 00:10:20,078
Ana?

203
00:10:23,540 --> 00:10:24,374
Ana?

204
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:26,501
Nanny Cedes!

205
00:10:26,918 --> 00:10:28,211
Nanny Cedes!

206
00:10:28,295 --> 00:10:30,547
Where's the bathroom key?

207
00:10:32,090 --> 00:10:33,300
Nanny Cedes!

208
00:10:33,383 --> 00:10:35,552
Ben, please pick up.

209
00:10:40,807 --> 00:10:42,434
Why won't he pick up?

210
00:10:49,524 --> 00:10:50,942
"Ben, please pick up. We need to talk."

211
00:10:51,902 --> 00:10:53,487
Nanny Cedes!

212
00:10:53,570 --> 00:10:54,529
Sir!

213
00:10:54,613 --> 00:10:56,198
- Here, Attorney.
- Ana, please open the door!

214
00:10:56,281 --> 00:10:57,699
- Here are the keys.
- Just stay there!

215
00:10:57,783 --> 00:10:59,743
- Just stay there!
- All right.

216
00:10:59,826 --> 00:11:00,827
Stay right there.

217
00:11:00,911 --> 00:11:02,496
Ana, please open the door!

218
00:11:18,345 --> 00:11:19,429
No...

219
00:11:24,226 --> 00:11:25,435
Can I come in?

220
00:11:25,519 --> 00:11:27,104
I'm telling you, please...

221
00:11:27,187 --> 00:11:29,773
Nothing happened, nothing happened.

222
00:11:30,732 --> 00:11:31,775
No!

223
00:11:43,245 --> 00:11:45,997
- Ana...
- Why?

224
00:11:47,165 --> 00:11:50,419
Ana, Ana... don't do it.

225
00:11:50,502 --> 00:11:52,254
Ana, please, don't hurt yourself.

226
00:11:52,712 --> 00:11:54,214
Ana, don't do it.

227
00:11:54,297 --> 00:11:55,674
Ana, look at me.

228
00:11:55,757 --> 00:11:58,385
No, no, no! Ana, please, I'm begging you.

229
00:11:58,468 --> 00:12:01,304
I'm begging you, please. No, no, no! Stop!

230
00:12:01,388 --> 00:12:03,849
Stop! Stop! Stop! Stop! Ana, Ana!

231
00:12:03,932 --> 00:12:06,560
Okay, okay, okay, okay.

232
00:12:06,643 --> 00:12:08,103
Do it to me instead.

233
00:12:09,229 --> 00:12:11,148
I can't live without you.

234
00:12:11,857 --> 00:12:13,191
I'll take it instead.

235
00:12:14,776 --> 00:12:17,362
Please, come on.

236
00:12:17,446 --> 00:12:19,448
Please, please...

237
00:12:21,032 --> 00:12:22,659
Let go, let go.

238
00:12:22,742 --> 00:12:23,702
Let it go.

239
00:12:23,785 --> 00:12:26,663
Okay, okay, okay...

240
00:12:26,746 --> 00:12:27,873
Okay, let go.

241
00:12:27,956 --> 00:12:30,208
It's okay...

242
00:12:32,836 --> 00:12:33,920
It's okay.

243
00:12:34,504 --> 00:12:36,631
- It's okay.
- No, don't touch me.

244
00:12:36,715 --> 00:12:39,217
- Please, don't touch me.
- Okay, okay.

245
00:12:39,301 --> 00:12:40,469
What do you need? Huh?

246
00:12:40,552 --> 00:12:41,553
What do you need?

247
00:12:42,596 --> 00:12:46,641
I just want to go to... Ma-Mama...

248
00:12:48,602 --> 00:12:50,270
Okay, go.

249
00:12:50,353 --> 00:12:52,647
Great, okay...

250
00:12:53,565 --> 00:12:54,816
I love you.

251
00:12:54,900 --> 00:12:55,817
No!

252
00:12:55,901 --> 00:12:57,861
- Let me out of here!
- Regina!

253
00:12:57,944 --> 00:13:00,989
- Let me out of here! I want to go out!
- Regina!

254
00:13:01,072 --> 00:13:02,991
- Get me out of here!
- Regina!

255
00:13:03,074 --> 00:13:05,410
- Please, get me out of here!
- Regina!

256
00:13:05,494 --> 00:13:07,370
Stop that! What are you doing?

257
00:13:07,454 --> 00:13:08,955
- You stop, Mara!
- Enough!

258
00:13:09,039 --> 00:13:11,082
You think I don't know
what you're doing, Mara?

259
00:13:11,166 --> 00:13:12,375
- I know what you're doing!
- Stop it!

260
00:13:12,459 --> 00:13:13,668
Stop! You'll hurt yourself again!

261
00:13:13,752 --> 00:13:16,421
I know why you're here with me!

262
00:13:16,505 --> 00:13:17,923
I know why you're looking after me!

263
00:13:18,006 --> 00:13:19,716
What are you saying? You'll hurt yourself!

264
00:13:19,799 --> 00:13:21,593
You'll gain nothing from me, Mara!

265
00:13:21,676 --> 00:13:23,428
Calm down, calm down!

266
00:13:23,512 --> 00:13:25,472
Okay? Calm down.

267
00:13:38,818 --> 00:13:39,903
Ana, come on.

268
00:13:39,986 --> 00:13:41,321
Be careful.

269
00:13:42,572 --> 00:13:43,740
Let me get that.

270
00:13:50,539 --> 00:13:51,748
Ana.

271
00:13:51,831 --> 00:13:52,958
Ana!

272
00:13:53,875 --> 00:13:54,918
Ana!

273
00:13:57,879 --> 00:13:58,880
Ana!

274
00:14:19,526 --> 00:14:20,819
Why?

275
00:14:20,902 --> 00:14:23,196
Why did you even try to do that, huh?

276
00:14:25,365 --> 00:14:27,033
I don't know.

277
00:14:28,577 --> 00:14:30,662
I just wanna die.

278
00:14:30,745 --> 00:14:32,789
Ugh, you idiot.

279
00:14:34,583 --> 00:14:35,792
Ana.

280
00:14:36,543 --> 00:14:38,628
I didn't save you the first time

281
00:14:38,712 --> 00:14:40,964
just for you to ruin your life.

282
00:14:42,591 --> 00:14:44,509
Why would you destroy yourself?

283
00:14:44,593 --> 00:14:46,386
You're the one who got cheated on!

284
00:14:47,637 --> 00:14:49,306
You know who should pay for this?

285
00:14:49,681 --> 00:14:51,808
Your husband's harlot of a side chick!

286
00:14:51,891 --> 00:14:53,018
It should be her!

287
00:14:55,353 --> 00:14:57,397
Come here. Listen to me.

288
00:14:57,480 --> 00:14:58,690
Sit up.

289
00:14:58,773 --> 00:14:59,774
Listen to me.

290
00:15:00,442 --> 00:15:01,943
Do you remember

291
00:15:02,611 --> 00:15:04,195
what I told you back then?

292
00:15:04,779 --> 00:15:07,240
Protect your marriage with your life.

293
00:15:07,324 --> 00:15:09,200
Because men...

294
00:15:09,951 --> 00:15:11,995
easily get tempted!

295
00:15:12,078 --> 00:15:14,164
So what you should do

296
00:15:14,831 --> 00:15:17,917
is get rid of the temptation!

297
00:15:20,545 --> 00:15:21,671
Ma?

298
00:15:23,214 --> 00:15:24,758
Come on, Ana.

299
00:15:28,553 --> 00:15:31,139
It's enough
that one of us made a mistake.

300
00:15:33,224 --> 00:15:36,811
That one allowed another woman
to ruin one marriage.

301
00:15:38,355 --> 00:15:39,481
Enough.

302
00:15:40,065 --> 00:15:41,316
Okay?

303
00:15:41,816 --> 00:15:43,985
Come here. Come here, baby.

304
00:16:05,590 --> 00:16:07,967
Here. I bought dinner.

305
00:16:10,845 --> 00:16:12,681
Because even a fool who's in love

306
00:16:13,431 --> 00:16:14,933
needs to eat.

307
00:16:17,602 --> 00:16:18,770


308
00:16:21,731 --> 00:16:23,483
And now you're bawling your eyes out.

309
00:16:24,693 --> 00:16:26,695
You were so brave earlier.

310
00:16:33,326 --> 00:16:36,830


311
00:16:36,913 --> 00:16:39,791
Beth, you were just supposed
to test his loyalty.

312
00:16:41,751 --> 00:16:44,796
Why did you let it get that far?

313
00:16:44,879 --> 00:16:46,047
Diane...

314
00:16:47,382 --> 00:16:50,218


315
00:16:50,301 --> 00:16:52,887
I'm not sure what I feel. It's like...

316
00:16:55,932 --> 00:16:57,892
it's like I was run over...

317
00:16:59,853 --> 00:17:02,480
without knowing where the car came from.

318
00:17:03,815 --> 00:17:05,233
Uh-huh.

319
00:17:05,942 --> 00:17:07,235
Hit-and-run.

320
00:17:07,736 --> 00:17:09,612
You could've just said that.

321
00:17:11,239 --> 00:17:13,241
What if I stab you with this?

322
00:17:14,242 --> 00:17:15,368
Do you want me to?

323
00:17:15,452 --> 00:17:16,870
So you could wake up.

324
00:17:21,416 --> 00:17:23,293
Diane, you don't understand.

325
00:17:25,628 --> 00:17:27,422
I really love Ben.

326
00:17:41,728 --> 00:17:42,771
Ma?

327
00:17:45,857 --> 00:17:48,359
Before the sun could even rise,
he's already there,

328
00:17:48,443 --> 00:17:49,778
according to the maid.

329
00:17:58,161 --> 00:18:00,163
And he said he's not going to leave

330
00:18:00,246 --> 00:18:02,040
until you talk to him.

331
00:18:10,840 --> 00:18:12,425
Ben! Ben!

332
00:18:12,509 --> 00:18:13,927
Ma'am, you're not allowed to be here.

333
00:18:14,010 --> 00:18:15,845
- I need to talk to him!
Please leave! You can't!

334
00:18:15,929 --> 00:18:16,846
- Why?
Sir Ben is not here!

335
00:18:16,930 --> 00:18:18,181
- I'll wait for him inside!
He's not here, ma'am!

336
00:18:18,264 --> 00:18:20,225
- I'm going to get in trouble.
I'll wait inside!

337
00:18:20,308 --> 00:18:23,102
- Ma'am! Ma'am, please leave!
I'll go wait inside.

338
00:18:23,186 --> 00:18:24,771
- You can't be here!
Why did you let her in?

339
00:18:24,854 --> 00:18:26,940
That's enough! Have you no shame?

340
00:18:27,023 --> 00:18:29,192
I just need a minute.
He won't answer my calls!

341
00:18:29,275 --> 00:18:30,568
It's only right to not answer you!

342
00:18:30,652 --> 00:18:33,363
You homewrecker! Are you not ashamed?

343
00:18:33,446 --> 00:18:37,575
April, close the gate!
He shouldn't talk to you!

344
00:18:37,659 --> 00:18:40,745
- Just one minute!
No! You homewrecker!

345
00:18:40,829 --> 00:18:42,914
- Close the gate, April!
Ma'am, please!

346
00:18:42,997 --> 00:18:44,707
- Don't ever come back here!
Ben!

347
00:18:44,791 --> 00:18:47,710
- Goodness me!
Ma'am, please open-- Ma'am!

348
00:18:51,339 --> 00:18:53,633


349
00:18:57,345 --> 00:18:58,346
Ma'am?

350
00:18:58,429 --> 00:18:59,931
- Hmm?
- He's still there.

351
00:19:00,515 --> 00:19:01,599
Okay.

352
00:19:04,519 --> 00:19:06,104
Poor Ben...

353
00:19:06,187 --> 00:19:08,773
Ma...

354
00:19:10,024 --> 00:19:11,568
I'm just saying.

355
00:19:11,651 --> 00:19:14,070


356
00:19:33,590 --> 00:19:35,174
Ben, will you please leave?

357
00:19:42,640 --> 00:19:43,975
I can't.

358
00:19:47,145 --> 00:19:48,855
I need to talk to my wife.

359
00:19:50,773 --> 00:19:52,942
Do you really think
she'll be able to talk to you?

360
00:19:54,152 --> 00:19:56,279
Ben, you've hurt my daughter.

361
00:20:04,996 --> 00:20:06,539
I'm-- I'm sorry.

362
00:20:08,666 --> 00:20:09,792
I'm sorry.

363
00:20:12,378 --> 00:20:13,713
But I don't have a mistress.

364
00:20:16,090 --> 00:20:18,092
That Beth is not my mistress...

365
00:20:19,260 --> 00:20:20,345
sir.

366
00:20:23,306 --> 00:20:25,642
I can never do that to my wife because...

367
00:20:25,725 --> 00:20:27,477
I love her so much.

368
00:20:28,728 --> 00:20:30,521
I love Ana so much.

369
00:20:33,066 --> 00:20:35,151
It's not right for you
to make a scene here.

370
00:20:35,860 --> 00:20:39,656
I'm not making a scene here.
I'm just here for my wife.

371
00:20:41,741 --> 00:20:44,202
I'm waiting because I want to talk to her.

372
00:21:21,781 --> 00:21:23,366
Ben, please, let's talk.

373
00:21:23,449 --> 00:21:24,784
We have nothing to talk about.

374
00:21:25,284 --> 00:21:27,203
- Ben, I'm begging you--
- Go away.

375
00:21:27,286 --> 00:21:29,747
I'm begging you, Ben. Ben.

376
00:21:35,086 --> 00:21:37,005
You know he's still out there, right?

377
00:21:43,386 --> 00:21:45,221
I didn't ask him to wait.

378
00:21:45,972 --> 00:21:47,390
He didn't go home.

379
00:21:48,057 --> 00:21:49,892
He didn't sleep or eat.

380
00:21:50,560 --> 00:21:53,563
If the nanny hadn't begged him,
he would have gone without water.

381
00:21:57,525 --> 00:21:58,776
He's crazy.

382
00:22:01,237 --> 00:22:03,156
He's crazy for you.

383
00:22:04,407 --> 00:22:07,076
Ma, it's not a compliment.

384
00:22:08,244 --> 00:22:09,245
Fine.

385
00:22:09,996 --> 00:22:12,749
You know, just talk to him. Okay?

386
00:22:13,374 --> 00:22:14,292
Why?

387
00:22:15,001 --> 00:22:17,837
Because you're not heartless, like me.

388
00:22:18,921 --> 00:22:20,673
Talk to him.

389
00:22:21,549 --> 00:22:24,552
If this goes on,
your husband might actually go crazy.

390
00:22:25,470 --> 00:22:26,637
Come on.

391
00:22:28,973 --> 00:22:30,475
I'm begging you. Let's talk.

392
00:22:30,558 --> 00:22:31,934
No, no, no, Beth.

393
00:22:32,477 --> 00:22:33,644
No, no, no.

394
00:22:33,728 --> 00:22:35,480
- Just this once, please.
- No.

395
00:22:35,563 --> 00:22:37,648
No, Beth. We have nothing to talk about.

396
00:22:47,116 --> 00:22:48,785
- I'm begging you. Talk to me.
- Stop it, Beth.

397
00:22:48,868 --> 00:22:50,411
Everything was fine until you came along.

398
00:22:50,495 --> 00:22:52,288
Come on.
Why are you still waiting for Ana?

399
00:22:52,371 --> 00:22:53,623
- Why?
- She doesn't--

400
00:22:53,706 --> 00:22:56,167
- she doesn't want you anymore.
- What do you mean? Huh?

401
00:22:56,250 --> 00:22:57,460
- Go away.
- You!

402
00:22:58,211 --> 00:22:59,212
Ana, hold on.

403
00:22:59,295 --> 00:23:02,173
You really can't help flirting
with my husband, huh?

404
00:23:02,256 --> 00:23:05,718
You seriously followed Ben
here to my mom's house?

405
00:23:06,344 --> 00:23:08,888
I wouldn't even be here
if only Ben had talked to me.

406
00:23:08,971 --> 00:23:10,014
- Stop, Beth.
- Oh!

407
00:23:10,098 --> 00:23:11,349
- Don't listen to her.
- You even had the guts

408
00:23:11,432 --> 00:23:12,725
to demand that Ben talk to you.

409
00:23:12,809 --> 00:23:16,521
Which Bible says you have
the right to someone else's spouse?

410
00:23:16,604 --> 00:23:18,106
- Ana, let's go.
- Don't I have the right

411
00:23:18,189 --> 00:23:19,482
- to speak?
- What?

412
00:23:19,565 --> 00:23:20,441
What are you going to say?

413
00:23:20,525 --> 00:23:22,110
All right, fine.

414
00:23:22,193 --> 00:23:23,444
Beth, go.

415
00:23:23,528 --> 00:23:25,071
- What?
- Go. Talk.

416
00:23:25,154 --> 00:23:26,280
- What?
- Tell her

417
00:23:26,364 --> 00:23:27,740
that we're not in a relationship.

418
00:23:27,824 --> 00:23:29,951
And that kiss.
Tell her about that kiss!

419
00:23:30,451 --> 00:23:32,286
That it was all on you. Come on!

420
00:23:32,370 --> 00:23:34,455
- Reynaldo! Get out of my way!
- Imelda!

421
00:23:34,956 --> 00:23:36,791
I can't let them
team up against Ana!

422
00:23:36,874 --> 00:23:38,459
- Imelda--
- Stop it!

423
00:23:38,543 --> 00:23:40,628
Your daughter isn't a child anymore.

424
00:23:40,711 --> 00:23:42,296
Don't meddle in her battles.

425
00:23:42,380 --> 00:23:44,841
Your daughter is in a fragile state!

426
00:23:44,924 --> 00:23:46,050
If something bad happens to her--

427
00:23:46,134 --> 00:23:48,344
I'll take care of it.

428
00:23:48,427 --> 00:23:49,846
I'll kill whoever hurts her.

429
00:23:50,304 --> 00:23:51,931
Coming from you? Really?

430
00:23:52,348 --> 00:23:55,101
Are you trying to be funny?
You're a big joke!

431
00:23:55,184 --> 00:23:57,228
- Oh, please! Get out of my way!
- Imelda! Imelda!

432
00:23:57,311 --> 00:23:58,980
Stop it!

433
00:23:59,063 --> 00:24:02,275
All I'm trying to say is,
don't you trust your daughter?

434
00:24:02,358 --> 00:24:04,193
That she can deal with this herself?

435
00:24:11,450 --> 00:24:13,161
Beth, please.

436
00:24:13,619 --> 00:24:14,787
Beth, come on, tell her.

437
00:24:14,871 --> 00:24:15,872
Yes.

438
00:24:16,706 --> 00:24:18,040
Ben and I are not in a relationship.

439
00:24:18,124 --> 00:24:20,418
Okay, let's go. Let's go...

440
00:24:20,501 --> 00:24:21,961
But I know that he likes me.

441
00:24:22,044 --> 00:24:22,920
What?

442
00:24:23,754 --> 00:24:25,756
- Oh, my God.
- Ben, I know it.

443
00:24:27,258 --> 00:24:28,676
I can feel it! I can see it!

444
00:24:28,759 --> 00:24:31,846
The way you held me.
The way you looked at me in the car.

445
00:24:31,929 --> 00:24:33,973
You always offered
to give me a ride, remember?

446
00:24:34,056 --> 00:24:37,059
Beth... that means nothing.

447
00:24:37,727 --> 00:24:38,936
You're nothing to me.

448
00:24:39,812 --> 00:24:43,065
Ben, you asked me
to come to the wharf.

449
00:24:44,358 --> 00:24:47,445
That message was for my wife.

450
00:24:47,528 --> 00:24:50,740
I've told you that. Wrong send, remember?

451
00:24:51,240 --> 00:24:52,658
Are you going crazy?

452
00:24:52,742 --> 00:24:54,869
Are you going crazy thinking
I want to be alone with you there?

453
00:24:54,952 --> 00:24:55,995
Me, crazy?

454
00:24:56,370 --> 00:24:57,955
What about your wife?

455
00:24:58,456 --> 00:25:00,374
Aren't you hurting yourself?

456
00:25:00,458 --> 00:25:01,584
- Am I right? I know that.
- Oh, okay.

457
00:25:01,667 --> 00:25:03,836
- Hey, hey, hey.
- Okay, okay, okay.

458
00:25:03,920 --> 00:25:05,504
So you think...

459
00:25:06,923 --> 00:25:09,342
- you think you're a better woman than me?
- Come on, Ana.

460
00:25:09,425 --> 00:25:11,761
That's why he likes you?

461
00:25:12,178 --> 00:25:13,512
Ana...

462
00:25:15,765 --> 00:25:17,516
Look at yourself.

463
00:25:18,267 --> 00:25:20,311
You're not special.

464
00:25:21,020 --> 00:25:23,439
- You're bland.
- Don't go there. Ana, let's go.

465
00:25:23,522 --> 00:25:24,732
You're cheap.

466
00:25:25,900 --> 00:25:27,735
Cheap? Really?

467
00:25:27,818 --> 00:25:29,862
- Look who's talking.
- Ana, stop. Ana, Ana.

468
00:25:29,946 --> 00:25:31,864
Between us,
who do you think acts more cheaply?

469
00:25:31,948 --> 00:25:35,952
The one who hired a loyalty tester
or me, who your husband wants?

470
00:25:38,746 --> 00:25:41,165
I get it! You're rich and pretty!

471
00:25:41,249 --> 00:25:43,125
But you're so insecure!

472
00:25:47,213 --> 00:25:49,632
Ana hired me to be a loyalty tester.

473
00:25:50,091 --> 00:25:52,051
To find out if you were having an affair.

474
00:25:52,635 --> 00:25:53,636
Listen to me, Ben.

475
00:25:53,719 --> 00:25:58,140
She didn't just do it once.
She did the loyalty testing twice!

476
00:25:59,725 --> 00:26:02,687
Once wasn't enough for her!

477
00:26:02,770 --> 00:26:05,106
You have a mad wife! She hired me.

478
00:26:05,189 --> 00:26:08,234
She hired me to test your loyalty again.

479
00:26:08,317 --> 00:26:09,735
Listen to me!

480
00:26:10,278 --> 00:26:12,863
Listen to me!
Your wife doesn't want you anymore!

481
00:26:12,947 --> 00:26:14,490
Your wife doesn't trust you!

482
00:26:14,573 --> 00:26:16,200
Your wife doesn't love you!

483
00:26:17,618 --> 00:26:19,453
Get out! Get out of my house!

484
00:26:19,537 --> 00:26:20,663
- Get out!
- Ben!

485
00:26:21,247 --> 00:26:23,749
Ben, please! Ben!

486
00:26:27,295 --> 00:26:28,504
Ben!

487
00:26:31,215 --> 00:26:33,050
What? What?

488
00:27:08,127 --> 00:27:09,628
Loyalty testing.

489
00:27:12,757 --> 00:27:14,550
That was unnecessary, Ana.

490
00:27:19,930 --> 00:27:22,016
Ben, it started that night.

491
00:27:22,099 --> 00:27:24,060
When you said you didn't leave,

492
00:27:24,143 --> 00:27:25,353
but you lied.

493
00:27:25,811 --> 00:27:27,480
So what did you want me to do?

494
00:27:29,065 --> 00:27:30,483
I explained it to you.

495
00:27:33,361 --> 00:27:36,447
The phone in your car.

496
00:27:37,198 --> 00:27:38,407
Not mine.

497
00:27:40,576 --> 00:27:42,912
I'm just saying, can you blame me?

498
00:27:50,002 --> 00:27:51,629
I just want to say...

499
00:27:53,923 --> 00:27:55,383
please trust me.

500
00:27:56,967 --> 00:27:58,010
That's all.

501
00:27:59,261 --> 00:28:00,554
Please trust me.

502
00:28:02,723 --> 00:28:05,059
Because I'm not being unfaithful.

503
00:28:11,399 --> 00:28:14,735
There are just so many things
about you that I don't get.

504
00:28:14,819 --> 00:28:17,279
- What things?
- Small things.

505
00:28:17,363 --> 00:28:18,572
And big things.

506
00:28:18,656 --> 00:28:22,368
Things I don't understand.
Things that don't add up.

507
00:28:22,993 --> 00:28:24,495
Then ask me.

508
00:28:24,995 --> 00:28:26,747
I'll explain things to you.

509
00:28:30,209 --> 00:28:33,379
Ana, you let this random person
in our lives.

510
00:28:34,755 --> 00:28:36,382
In our life.

511
00:28:37,633 --> 00:28:38,801
Okay?

512
00:28:38,884 --> 00:28:42,972
And all of this happened
just because of loyalty testing.

513
00:28:49,562 --> 00:28:50,980
I'm sorry.

514
00:28:54,775 --> 00:28:56,152
Ana...

515
00:28:58,487 --> 00:28:59,947
it's okay.

516
00:29:00,030 --> 00:29:01,073
It's okay.

517
00:29:01,782 --> 00:29:03,033
I love you.

518
00:29:04,660 --> 00:29:06,245
Ana, it's okay.

519
00:29:06,954 --> 00:29:08,080
It's okay.

520
00:29:10,708 --> 00:29:12,877
Please, let's stop fighting.

521
00:29:15,588 --> 00:29:17,423
Okay? Come here.

522
00:29:19,592 --> 00:29:20,759
It's okay.

523
00:29:20,843 --> 00:29:22,428
It's okay.

524
00:29:24,972 --> 00:29:26,140
It's okay.

525
00:29:27,933 --> 00:29:29,101
It's okay.

526
00:29:31,770 --> 00:29:33,189
Will you be okay?

527
00:29:34,482 --> 00:29:35,774
Yes.

528
00:29:35,858 --> 00:29:38,944
You know, I think
you should talk to my doctor.

529
00:29:40,821 --> 00:29:44,074
- Doctor?
- Yeah. My therapist.

530
00:29:44,158 --> 00:29:46,494
You might need someone to talk to.

531
00:29:46,577 --> 00:29:48,037
Ma, I...

532
00:29:48,913 --> 00:29:50,331
A visit won't hurt.

533
00:29:54,001 --> 00:29:55,169
Benjamin.

534
00:29:56,670 --> 00:29:57,963
I'm very sorry.

535
00:29:59,173 --> 00:30:00,466
I'm very, very sorry.

536
00:30:05,387 --> 00:30:07,139
Thank you, Ma.

537
00:30:07,223 --> 00:30:08,432
Take care.

538
00:30:24,573 --> 00:30:26,075
Anyone home?

539
00:30:26,492 --> 00:30:28,285
Hi, Auntie Beth!

540
00:30:28,369 --> 00:30:29,912
Caloy is here.

541
00:30:29,995 --> 00:30:31,664
Just leave him there. I'll look after him.

542
00:30:31,747 --> 00:30:33,832
Come on, dear.
Let's go to Auntie Beth's room.

543
00:30:37,670 --> 00:30:39,088
Stay there, okay?

544
00:30:42,633 --> 00:30:43,759
H-Hello?

545
00:30:43,842 --> 00:30:44,885
Hello, Ben!

546
00:30:44,969 --> 00:30:47,972
Maybe we can talk now.
Ana isn't around, is she?

547
00:30:48,264 --> 00:30:49,265
Hello?

548
00:30:51,850 --> 00:30:53,185
Aren't you done yet?

549
00:30:54,478 --> 00:30:55,980
What the hell, Diane?

550
00:30:58,732 --> 00:31:00,234
You broke my phone!

551
00:31:00,317 --> 00:31:02,987
Snap out of it, Betchay!
Stop bothering Attorney Ben.

552
00:31:03,946 --> 00:31:05,698
I'll just tell him that I'm right.

553
00:31:05,781 --> 00:31:07,449
That won't change his mind, Beth.

554
00:31:07,533 --> 00:31:09,910
You were wrong from the very beginning.

555
00:31:10,494 --> 00:31:13,414
You know what, I don't know
if you're a fool or just plain stupid.

556
00:31:14,832 --> 00:31:16,125
Ben loves me.

557
00:31:18,752 --> 00:31:21,755
He loves you?
Did you hear him say that?

558
00:31:22,423 --> 00:31:27,595
Did he say, "Beth, I love you.
I'll leave my wife for you"?

559
00:31:27,678 --> 00:31:29,138
Was it that clear?

560
00:31:29,221 --> 00:31:31,432
He can't tell me,

561
00:31:31,515 --> 00:31:35,060
because his damn wife
is always hanging around!

562
00:31:35,603 --> 00:31:36,854
Beth!

563
00:31:38,689 --> 00:31:42,026
No matter what you say,
that's what I felt.

564
00:31:45,279 --> 00:31:46,405
Diane...

565
00:31:49,658 --> 00:31:53,912
I've given my all my whole life,
you know that.

566
00:31:55,122 --> 00:31:58,459
But Ben is the only one
I haven't given anything to.

567
00:31:59,376 --> 00:32:02,546
Yet he's the only one
who made me feel I'm worthy...

568
00:32:03,297 --> 00:32:08,886
to be saved, cared for, protected...

569
00:32:10,846 --> 00:32:13,766
He did all that
without asking for anything in return.

570
00:32:16,602 --> 00:32:18,896
Now tell me he doesn't love me.

571
00:32:21,106 --> 00:32:25,110
Betchay, that's concern.
It's just concern, nothing more.

572
00:32:26,153 --> 00:32:28,697
He showed you a little kindness,

573
00:32:28,781 --> 00:32:30,908
and you think he's in love with you?
Have you lost your mind?

574
00:32:31,992 --> 00:32:34,078
Diane, you don't get it.
You don't understand

575
00:32:34,161 --> 00:32:36,580
because you haven't seen
the way he looks at me.

576
00:32:37,581 --> 00:32:38,999
Diane, I'm not crazy.

577
00:32:39,958 --> 00:32:42,670
I'm not losing my mind, Diane,
what I'm saying is true.

578
00:32:43,087 --> 00:32:44,963
That's why I need Ben.

579
00:32:45,047 --> 00:32:47,424
I can't have peace if I'm not with him.

580
00:32:48,133 --> 00:32:49,718
Diane, please help me--

581
00:32:51,011 --> 00:32:52,096
So?

582
00:32:53,305 --> 00:32:55,391
Are you awake now, huh?

583
00:32:56,183 --> 00:32:57,893
Are your eyes finally open?

584
00:32:58,852 --> 00:33:00,729
I won't help you, Beth.

585
00:33:01,689 --> 00:33:05,192
I'll only stand by you
if you stop this madness.

586
00:33:06,860 --> 00:33:08,987
You're destroying yourself.

587
00:33:11,490 --> 00:33:13,242
Caloy and I are leaving.

588
00:33:33,512 --> 00:33:36,682
So, are you saying I'm not okay?

589
00:33:37,641 --> 00:33:38,851
You look worried.

590
00:33:38,934 --> 00:33:40,102
I understand.

591
00:33:40,185 --> 00:33:44,064
But not being okay is not a failure.
It is information.

592
00:33:45,232 --> 00:33:47,651
I-I just...

593
00:33:49,194 --> 00:33:51,530
Do I have
the same condition as Mama?

594
00:33:51,613 --> 00:33:53,574
Well, every case is different.

595
00:33:53,657 --> 00:33:56,994
There are other factors
like environment, experiences,

596
00:33:57,077 --> 00:33:59,538
coping habits, and other things.

597
00:34:01,832 --> 00:34:03,250
I love my mother.

598
00:34:04,543 --> 00:34:07,629
But I don't... I don't want to be like...

599
00:34:08,255 --> 00:34:09,757
Look, Ana...

600
00:34:09,840 --> 00:34:11,508
just focus on what matters now.

601
00:34:11,592 --> 00:34:13,844
I'm going to prescribe you some meds.

602
00:34:13,927 --> 00:34:17,431
But that alone will not fix things.
Therapy can help.

603
00:34:28,484 --> 00:34:29,651
Get over here!

604
00:34:30,527 --> 00:34:33,071
- Why is he there?
- Uh...

605
00:34:35,073 --> 00:34:38,076
- Is he still alive?
- I don't know, ma'am.

606
00:34:58,180 --> 00:34:59,598
Sorry, I fell asleep.

607
00:35:03,977 --> 00:35:06,814
Don't ever do that again, okay?

608
00:35:08,941 --> 00:35:10,275
I'm going to eat now.

609
00:35:17,658 --> 00:35:20,160
I told the office
I'm taking the day off.

610
00:35:20,744 --> 00:35:22,746
- Ben? No.
- Mm?

611
00:35:22,830 --> 00:35:24,706
You're missing too much work lately.

612
00:35:24,790 --> 00:35:26,583
Oh, that's not true.

613
00:35:26,667 --> 00:35:29,086
I'm still answering calls and e-mails.
I have my phone.

614
00:35:30,337 --> 00:35:33,257
You know what the best thing
about being a CEO is?

615
00:35:34,466 --> 00:35:36,969
I can make other people do my job.

616
00:35:37,052 --> 00:35:40,764
Hey, don't be
that kind of boss everyone hates.

617
00:35:40,848 --> 00:35:42,266
I'm just kidding.

618
00:35:43,058 --> 00:35:44,560
They know I want to spend time with you,

619
00:35:44,643 --> 00:35:46,144
so I took the day off.

620
00:35:46,228 --> 00:35:47,980
What?
But the doctor's appointment is over.

621
00:35:48,856 --> 00:35:51,692
- We're going somewhere.
- Where?

622
00:35:51,775 --> 00:35:52,985
Patience, my love.

623
00:35:55,279 --> 00:35:57,197
- Ben?
- Get in.

624
00:36:18,010 --> 00:36:20,929
Beth is so stupid. What was she thinking?

625
00:36:23,348 --> 00:36:25,934
Do you really think
she'd talk about her nonsense?

626
00:36:26,768 --> 00:36:29,688
Plus, a lot happened with my son and me.

627
00:36:31,398 --> 00:36:35,360
Sweetie, sit down. Go play with your toys.

628
00:36:35,444 --> 00:36:38,071
So, what's her plan now, anyway?

629
00:36:40,157 --> 00:36:42,409
She says she loves and needs the attorney.

630
00:36:43,619 --> 00:36:46,830
Wow, she's totally lost it!

631
00:36:46,914 --> 00:36:49,917
I talked to her and literally slapped her,

632
00:36:50,000 --> 00:36:52,294
but nothing changed.

633
00:36:52,377 --> 00:36:55,756
So Caloy and I just left
because I really can't help her.

634
00:36:58,926 --> 00:37:02,429
Then there's another problem
when you got home.

635
00:37:03,889 --> 00:37:07,142
How was I to know that bastard
was already waiting at my house?

636
00:37:08,560 --> 00:37:10,103
Oh, man, Bridge...

637
00:37:11,605 --> 00:37:13,482
Ugh, I'm so tired.

638
00:37:15,567 --> 00:37:17,235
I'm just so exhausted.

639
00:37:20,030 --> 00:37:23,784
But look at your son,
he still has so much energy.

640
00:37:28,997 --> 00:37:31,750
Hang in there, babe. Come on.

641
00:37:32,459 --> 00:37:35,837
The time will come for us to win.

642
00:37:36,797 --> 00:37:39,549
Just have faith. You got this.

643
00:37:43,512 --> 00:37:44,680
Okay.

644
00:37:49,267 --> 00:37:51,103
Do you remember this place?

645
00:37:52,145 --> 00:37:54,147
This is where we said our vows.

646
00:37:58,235 --> 00:37:59,653
What was that again?

647
00:38:01,488 --> 00:38:03,031
You forgot already?

648
00:38:03,115 --> 00:38:05,993
Ana... never.

649
00:38:09,871 --> 00:38:11,623
For as long as I breathe...

650
00:38:13,667 --> 00:38:15,752
and I love you more than my life.

651
00:38:19,214 --> 00:38:20,716
Is it still the same?

652
00:38:20,799 --> 00:38:22,300
Of course, Ana.

653
00:38:23,343 --> 00:38:24,553
Always.

654
00:38:25,220 --> 00:38:26,805
It will never change.

655
00:38:32,144 --> 00:38:33,729
Let's go home?

656
00:38:36,189 --> 00:38:37,816
Are we okay now?

657
00:38:40,444 --> 00:38:41,820
We should be.

658
00:38:43,864 --> 00:38:45,198
I made a mistake.

659
00:38:46,283 --> 00:38:51,288
I trusted my gut feeling
more than I trusted my husband.

660
00:38:52,664 --> 00:38:56,251
But you know my fears,
my pains growing up...

661
00:38:56,334 --> 00:38:57,586
Yes, Ana, I know.

662
00:38:57,669 --> 00:38:59,087
I just don't want to end up like Mama.

663
00:38:59,713 --> 00:39:02,215
No. Never.

664
00:39:03,300 --> 00:39:04,843
I'm sorry.

665
00:39:06,136 --> 00:39:07,596
God knows I love you.

666
00:39:08,513 --> 00:39:10,974
I love you too, Ana, so much. I love you.

667
00:39:15,228 --> 00:39:17,064
But it still hurts.

668
00:39:18,482 --> 00:39:19,649
What?

669
00:39:22,069 --> 00:39:23,653
The kiss.

670
00:39:26,406 --> 00:39:27,866
I know, I know.

671
00:39:30,702 --> 00:39:35,123
Just let me be jealous for a while.

672
00:39:36,374 --> 00:39:37,793
Okay.

673
00:39:39,336 --> 00:39:40,170
Okay.

674
00:39:57,312 --> 00:39:58,730
Angel!

675
00:40:02,067 --> 00:40:04,236
This is the only way we could think of...

676
00:40:06,196 --> 00:40:08,448
to say goodbye to you.

677
00:40:10,408 --> 00:40:13,703
Because we don't know where Eric took you.

678
00:40:17,290 --> 00:40:20,418
But we hope these will reach you.

679
00:40:29,136 --> 00:40:30,554
Cheers?

680
00:40:31,429 --> 00:40:33,765
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

681
00:40:34,432 --> 00:40:36,434
No alcohol for you.

682
00:40:41,731 --> 00:40:42,941
Caloy?

683
00:40:53,368 --> 00:40:55,912
I understand
if you can't send Caloy to school.

684
00:40:56,413 --> 00:40:58,623
But what about his therapy sessions?

685
00:40:58,707 --> 00:41:01,626
Diane, you know the kid needs them.

686
00:41:01,710 --> 00:41:04,129
Mike, I'm not neglecting Caloy.

687
00:41:05,172 --> 00:41:06,339
I'm just looking for--

688
00:41:06,423 --> 00:41:09,718
What? Another doctor to assess him?

689
00:41:09,801 --> 00:41:12,137
Are you gonna make him adjust
to a new treatment plan?

690
00:41:12,929 --> 00:41:14,139
Come on, Diane!

691
00:41:14,973 --> 00:41:16,057
Mike, please.

692
00:41:17,017 --> 00:41:19,019
Don't give me that attitude.

693
00:41:19,853 --> 00:41:22,439
You shouldn't have kept my son
away from me.

694
00:41:23,648 --> 00:41:25,233
Quit being selfish.

695
00:41:26,026 --> 00:41:30,030
You keep demanding to spend time with him.

696
00:41:30,113 --> 00:41:32,782
But have you really thought
about Caloy's well-being?

697
00:41:33,491 --> 00:41:36,077
Do you think
you can give him what he needs?

698
00:41:37,245 --> 00:41:39,206
Daddy! Daddy!

699
00:41:52,677 --> 00:41:54,512
Are you and Ben okay now?

700
00:41:56,139 --> 00:41:57,349
Yes.

701
00:41:58,391 --> 00:41:59,684
No, I...

702
00:42:00,977 --> 00:42:01,978
I guess so.

703
00:42:03,480 --> 00:42:05,857
I want us to be okay.

704
00:42:05,941 --> 00:42:08,944
That's why I went home with him.

705
00:42:09,569 --> 00:42:11,780
But have you talked about...

706
00:42:13,198 --> 00:42:14,950
...the loyalty testing?

707
00:42:15,742 --> 00:42:16,952
Yes.

708
00:42:18,411 --> 00:42:19,537
And...

709
00:42:21,748 --> 00:42:23,458
he forgave me.

710
00:42:23,959 --> 00:42:25,377
Right away?

711
00:42:26,920 --> 00:42:28,129
Yes.

712
00:42:30,090 --> 00:42:32,092
Well, of course...

713
00:42:32,968 --> 00:42:34,552
he got mad.

714
00:42:36,471 --> 00:42:39,182
He was offended and hurt.

715
00:42:41,017 --> 00:42:41,935
But...

716
00:42:42,602 --> 00:42:45,730
h-he said he understood
where I was coming from.

717
00:42:47,023 --> 00:42:49,693
Maybe I should apologize to Ben too.

718
00:42:49,776 --> 00:42:52,070
I was the one
who suggested the loyalty test.

719
00:42:52,153 --> 00:42:54,698
No, Kat, it's not your fault.

720
00:42:55,740 --> 00:42:58,076
You might've suggested it,

721
00:42:58,159 --> 00:43:00,161
but I could've chosen not to do it.

722
00:43:02,289 --> 00:43:06,793
In the end,
I decided to do that loyalty test.

723
00:43:15,385 --> 00:43:18,305
Ana, is that her?

724
00:43:33,862 --> 00:43:35,280
It's okay, Kat.

725
00:43:46,166 --> 00:43:47,751
Set Ben free.

726
00:43:49,461 --> 00:43:54,049
Has everything that happened
not sunk in yet?

727
00:43:55,050 --> 00:43:56,551
I won't stop until--

728
00:43:56,634 --> 00:43:58,720
Until you get my husband?

729
00:44:04,934 --> 00:44:06,102
Tell me.

730
00:44:07,103 --> 00:44:09,522
After you confronted me and Ben...

731
00:44:11,858 --> 00:44:13,443
has he reached out to you?

732
00:44:16,279 --> 00:44:17,697
Has he sent you a message?

733
00:44:18,907 --> 00:44:20,283
Or checked up on you?

734
00:44:21,868 --> 00:44:23,036
No?

735
00:44:24,371 --> 00:44:28,375
And you still think my husband likes you?

736
00:44:29,042 --> 00:44:32,212
He can't do any of that because of you.

737
00:44:33,380 --> 00:44:38,301
He hasn't reached out to you
because he doesn't like you.

738
00:44:38,385 --> 00:44:40,845
I'm the one Ben likes.

739
00:44:40,929 --> 00:44:42,972
I'm the one he loves.

740
00:44:43,765 --> 00:44:45,183
This conversation is going nowhere,

741
00:44:45,266 --> 00:44:48,395
so please just stop.

742
00:44:50,230 --> 00:44:52,148
But this is your fault.

743
00:44:53,566 --> 00:44:55,735
You're the reason Ben and I met.

744
00:44:57,070 --> 00:44:58,405
That's true.

745
00:44:59,114 --> 00:45:00,573
I admit.

746
00:45:02,075 --> 00:45:06,496
If it wasn't for the loyalty test,
you wouldn't have fallen for him.

747
00:45:07,205 --> 00:45:08,873
But it's done.

748
00:45:09,457 --> 00:45:11,626
He passed the test.

749
00:45:12,502 --> 00:45:14,337
But your husband isn't loyal.

750
00:45:14,421 --> 00:45:17,507
It was just one kiss that you started.

751
00:45:17,590 --> 00:45:19,050
Ben has another woman!

752
00:45:25,140 --> 00:45:26,850
You didn't know, did you?

753
00:45:26,933 --> 00:45:28,435
He didn't tell you?

754
00:45:29,561 --> 00:45:31,563
He met with a woman.

755
00:45:32,939 --> 00:45:34,607
A beautiful woman.

756
00:45:59,799 --> 00:46:02,135
You expect me to believe that?

757
00:46:02,927 --> 00:46:04,846
Coming from you,

758
00:46:04,929 --> 00:46:08,141
the woman who insists I leave my husband?

759
00:46:08,641 --> 00:46:09,893
You and your delusions--

760
00:46:14,439 --> 00:46:15,857
Are you finally awake?

761
00:46:17,400 --> 00:46:20,028
You're the one who needs to wake up.

762
00:46:20,111 --> 00:46:22,947
You can reach all you want,

763
00:46:23,031 --> 00:46:27,452
but you will never ever touch what's mine.

764
00:46:36,085 --> 00:46:37,754
The show's over.

765
00:47:02,320 --> 00:47:04,447
- Hey, what are you doing?
- I'm leaving.

766
00:47:04,531 --> 00:47:07,534
- I'm leaving. I must find Joel!
- Give me back the keys!

767
00:47:07,617 --> 00:47:09,786
- Let me go! Let me go!
- You can't leave!

768
00:47:09,869 --> 00:47:13,081
I need to find Joel!
At least let me find his body!

769
00:47:13,164 --> 00:47:15,166
No, Regina! Give me back the keys!

770
00:47:15,250 --> 00:47:18,044
Let me go!
Why won't you let me go?

771
00:47:18,127 --> 00:47:20,004
Please let me go!

772
00:47:20,088 --> 00:47:21,923
At least let me find Joel's body!

773
00:47:22,006 --> 00:47:24,884
- Regina, you have to calm down.
- How? I need to find Joel!

774
00:47:24,968 --> 00:47:28,137
- Unlock this door! I'm leaving!
- I said calm down!

775
00:47:28,221 --> 00:47:30,223
Calm down.

776
00:47:30,306 --> 00:47:33,643
- I want to see Joel...
- Calm down now.

777
00:47:34,269 --> 00:47:37,438
I'm right here.

778
00:47:37,522 --> 00:47:40,149
Okay...

779
00:47:47,615 --> 00:47:51,619
<i>Your father committed suicide.</i>
<i>This case is closed.</i>

780
00:47:51,703 --> 00:47:53,538
- Sir!
- Escort her out!

781
00:47:53,621 --> 00:47:56,916
Sir, please help us. My father was killed.

782
00:47:57,000 --> 00:47:59,460
Please believe me! I just need your help!

783
00:47:59,544 --> 00:48:01,629
- Escort her out.
- Sir, please help us.

784
00:48:02,088 --> 00:48:06,676
You're all useless! I'm not leaving
before I get justice for my father!

785
00:48:06,759 --> 00:48:08,177
I'm sorry, miss.

786
00:48:08,261 --> 00:48:11,514
Hey, did you follow
the guy I told you about?

787
00:48:11,598 --> 00:48:14,934
<i>Yes,</i>
<i>I'll send you a picture of his companion.</i>

788
00:48:16,603 --> 00:48:18,855
<i>Thanks for your help.</i>
<i>Sorry for the trouble.</i>

789
00:48:18,938 --> 00:48:20,189
<i>Please send it right away.</i>

790
00:48:20,273 --> 00:48:22,025
<i>I'm not doing this again, okay?</i>

791
00:48:22,567 --> 00:48:24,902
<i>Let your father's soul rest.</i>

792
00:48:25,778 --> 00:48:27,697
- Cheers!
- Come on, guys!

793
00:48:27,780 --> 00:48:30,450
Guys! Come on, join us.

794
00:48:43,504 --> 00:48:45,173
I think I know you.

795
00:48:46,466 --> 00:48:48,134
Actually...

796
00:48:51,304 --> 00:48:52,972
I know you too.

797
00:49:01,731 --> 00:49:03,149
You know...

798
00:49:05,985 --> 00:49:07,570
there's something we need to discuss.

799
00:49:10,073 --> 00:49:10,948
Really?

800
00:49:11,032 --> 00:49:13,034
