- You killed my husband!
- No!

950
00:59:52,131 --> 00:59:55,134
You killed my husband!
You killed my husband!

951
00:59:55,217 --> 00:59:56,677
You killed my husband!

952
00:59:56,760 --> 00:59:59,680
- You killed my husband!
- Ging.

953
